<title>USA: GOLF-FINAL SCORES FROM TOUR CHAMPIONSHIP, WON BY LEHMAN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL SCORES FROM TOUR CHAMPIONSHIP, WON BY LEHMAN.</headline>
